    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>ForgeCLI — 开源命令行工具文档</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  :root {\n    --bg: #0d1117;\n    --surface: #161b22;\n    --surface-2: #1c2330;\n    --border: #2d333b;\n    --text: #e6edf3;\n    --text-dim: #8b949e;\n    --accent: #58d6a6;\n    --accent-dark: #1f7a5a;\n    --code-bg: #0a0e14;\n    --mono: ui-monospace, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, \"Courier New\", monospace;\n  }\n  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  code, pre { font-family: var(--mono); }\n\n  /* ---------- header ---------- */\n  .site-header {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    background: var(--surface);\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .header-inner {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 14px 24px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n  .brand img { width: 32px; height: 32px; display: block; }\n  .brand-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }\n  .brand-name span { color: var(--accent); }\n  .nav { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }\n  .nav a {\n    color: var(--text-dim);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }\n  .nav-badge {\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    color: var(--accent);\n    background: var(--surface-2);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- hero ---------- */\n  .hero {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 88px 24px 72px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 48px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hero-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);\n    background: rgba(88, 214, 166, 0.08);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    padding: 4px 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: 44px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 em {\n    font-style: normal;\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .hero p.lead {\n    color: var(--text-dim);\n    font-size: 17px;\n    max-width: 480px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; }\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 12px 22px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .btn-primary {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: #06231a;\n  }\n  .btn-ghost {\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    color: var(--text);\n    background: var(--surface);\n  }\n\n  .terminal {\n    background: var(--code-bg);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\n  }\n  .terminal-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    background: var(--surface);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; }\n  .dot.r { background: #ff5f56; }\n  .dot.y { background: #ffbd2e; }\n  .dot.g { background: #27c93f; }\n  .terminal-title {\n    margin-left: auto;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--text-dim);\n  }\n  .terminal-body {\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    white-space: pre;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n  .terminal-body .prompt { color: var(--accent); }\n  .terminal-body .cmd { color: var(--text); }\n  .terminal-body .out { color: var(--text-dim); }\n  .terminal-body .ok { color: #7ee787; }\n\n  /* ---------- features ---------- */\n  .features {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    background: var(--surface);\n  }\n  .features-inner {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 72px 24px;\n  }\n  .section-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 48px;\n  }\n  .section-heading h2 { font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .section-heading p { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 15px; }\n  .feature-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .feature-card {\n    background: var(--surface-2);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 26px 24px;\n  }\n  .feature-icon {\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: rgba(88, 214, 166, 0.12);\n    border: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .feature-icon img { width: 22px; height: 22px; display: block; }\n  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .feature-card p { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; }\n\n  /* ---------- install ---------- */\n  .install {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 72px 24px;\n  }\n  .install-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 40px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .install h2 { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .install .sub { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .steps { list-style: none; }\n  .steps li {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .steps li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .step-num {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: #06231a;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .steps strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 2px; }\n  .steps span { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; }\n\n  .code-block {\n    background: var(--code-bg);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 20px 22px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n  }\n  .code-block .c { color: #6e7681; }\n  .code-block .p { color: var(--accent); }\n  .code-block .s { color: #a5d6ff; }\n  .code-block .k { color: #ff7b72; }\n\n  /* ---------- stats ---------- */\n  .stats {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    background: var(--surface);\n  }\n  .stats-inner {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 56px 24px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .stat-value {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .stat-label { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }\n\n  /* ---------- footer ---------- */\n  .site-footer {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .footer-inner {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 24px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .footer-inner p { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13px; }\n  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }\n  .footer-links a { color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }\n  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }\n\n  @media (max-width: 860px) {\n    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 56px; }\n    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .install-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n    .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; }\n    .nav a:not(.nav-badge) { display: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"site-header\" data-oey-section=\"site-header\">\n  <div class=\"header-inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <img data-oey-object=\"site-header.logo\" alt=\"ForgeCLI 标志\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\">\n      <span class=\"brand-name\" data-oey-object=\"site-header.brand-name\">Forge<span>CLI</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"nav\">\n      <a href=\"#features\" data-oey-object=\"site-header.nav-docs\">文档</a>\n      <a href=\"#install\" data-oey-object=\"site-header.nav-install\">安装</a>\n      <a href=\"#stats\" data-oey-object=\"site-header.nav-community\">社区</a>\n      <span class=\"nav-badge\" data-oey-object=\"site-header.version-badge\">v3.2.1</span>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section class=\"hero\" data-oey-section=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n    <span class=\"hero-tag\" data-oey-object=\"hero.tag\">MIT 许可 · 完全开源</span>\n    <h1 data-oey-object=\"hero.title\">为开发者打造的<br><em>极速构建</em>命令行工具</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-oey-object=\"hero.subtitle\">ForgeCLI 用 Rust 编写，启动毫秒级、插件化架构、零配置上手。一条命令完成项目脚手架、构建、测试与发布全流程。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#install\" data-oey-object=\"hero.cta-primary\">快速开始</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#features\" data-oey-object=\"hero.cta-secondary\">查看文档</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"terminal\" data-oey-object=\"hero.terminal-demo\">\n    <div class=\"terminal-bar\">\n      <span class=\"dot r\"></span><span class=\"dot y\"></span><span class=\"dot g\"></span>\n      <span class=\"terminal-title\">bash — forge</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"terminal-body\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"cmd\">forge init my-app</span>\n<span class=\"out\">  正在创建项目脚手架...</span>\n<span class=\"ok\">  ✓ 生成 12 个文件 (84ms)</span>\n\n<span class=\"prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"cmd\">cd my-app && forge build</span>\n<span class=\"out\">  编译 128 个模块...</span>\n<span class=\"ok\">  ✓ 构建完成 dist/ (1.2s)</span>\n\n<span class=\"prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"cmd\">forge test --coverage</span>\n<span class=\"ok\">  ✓ 42 个测试全部通过</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"features\" id=\"features\" data-oey-section=\"features\">\n  <div class=\"features-inner\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <h2 data-oey-object=\"features.heading\">为什么选择 ForgeCLI</h2>\n      <p data-oey-object=\"features.subheading\">四个核心设计理念，覆盖从初始化到发布的每一个环节。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n          <img data-oey-object=\"features.icon-speed\" alt=\"闪电图标\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCI+PHBhdGggZD0iTTEzIDJMMyAxNGg3bC0xIDggMTAtMTJoLTdsMS04eiIgZmlsbD0iIzU4ZDZhNiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"features.card1-title\">毫秒级启动</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"features.card1-text\">Rust 原生编译，无运行时依赖。冷启动小于 50ms，增量构建只处理变更模块，大型项目也能秒级完成。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n          <img data-oey-object=\"features.icon-plugin\" alt=\"拼图图标\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"features.card2-title\">插件化架构</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"features.card2-text\">通过声明式清单扩展任意命令。官方市场已有 300+ 插件，涵盖部署、数据库迁移、代码生成等场景。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n          <img data-oey-object=\"features.icon-config\" alt=\"齿轮图标\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 data-oey-object=\"features.card3-title\">零配置上手</h3>\n        <p data-oey-object=\"features.card3-text\">智能识别项目类型，自动推断合理默认值。需要定制时，一份 forge.toml 即可覆盖所有行为。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"install\" id=\"install\" data-oey-section=\"install\">\n  <div class=\"install-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 data-oey-object=\"install.heading\">三分钟完成安装</h2>\n      <p class=\"sub\" data-oey-object=\"install.subheading\">支持 macOS、Linux 与 Windows，也可从源码自行编译。</p>\n      <ul class=\"steps\">\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">1</span>\n          <div>\n            <strong data-oey-object=\"install.step1-title\">运行安装脚本</strong>\n            <span data-oey-object=\"install.step1-text\">使用系统自带的包管理器或一键脚本，自动检测平台并下载对应二进制。</span>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">2</span>\n          <div>\n            <strong data-oey-object=\"install.step2-title\">初始化第一个项目</strong>\n            <span data-oey-object=\"install.step2-text\">forge init 会引导你选择模板与工具链，生成可直接运行的工程结构。</span>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"step-num\">3</span>\n          <div>\n            <strong data-oey-object=\"install.step3-title\">探索命令帮助</strong>\n            <span data-oey-object=\"install.step3-text\">每个子命令都内置 --help 与示例，配合 forge docs 可在浏览器中打开本地文档。</span>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-block\" data-oey-object=\"install.code-sample\"><span class=\"c\"># 使用一键脚本安装</span>\n<span class=\"p\">$</span> curl -fsSL forge.dev/install.sh | sh\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 或者通过包管理器</span>\n<span class=\"p\">$</span> brew install forgecli\n<span class=\"p\">$</span> cargo install forgecli\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 验证安装</span>\n<span class=\"p\">$</span> forge --version\n<span class=\"s\">forgecli 3.2.1 (stable, 2024-05)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\"># 创建并构建项目</span>\n<span class=\"p\">$</span> forge init my-app <span class=\"k\">--template</span> web\n<span class=\"p\">$</span> forge build <span class=\"k\">--release</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\" data-oey-section=\"stats\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" data-oey-object=\"stats.stars-value\">28.4k</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" data-oey-object=\"stats.stars-label\">GitHub Stars</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" data-oey-object=\"stats.contributors-value\">412</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" data-oey-object=\"stats.contributors-label\">贡献者</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" data-oey-object=\"stats.plugins-value\">300+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" data-oey-object=\"stats.plugins-label\">社区插件</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" data-oey-object=\"stats.downloads-value\">1.9M</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\" data-oey-object=\"stats.downloads-label\">月下载量</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" data-oey-section=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n    <p data-oey-object=\"site-footer.copyright\">© 2024 ForgeCLI 社区 · 基于 MIT 协议开源发布</p>\n    <div class=\"footer-links\">\n      <a href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"site-footer.link-github\">GitHub 仓库</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"site-footer.link-changelog\">更新日志</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" data-oey-object=\"site-footer.link-contributing\">参与贡献</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
